<td style="width:50%;"><b>戰國策卷九</b>　齊二<br /><span style="color:#999999">作者：</span><a href="/wiki/Author:%E5%8A%89%E5%90%91" title="Author:劉向">劉向</a>　<span style="color:#999999">西漢</span>
</td>
